post("CR-04", "customer-reality", "static",
     "Just one. And then the rest next year.",
     "“Can you just do the front one for now and we’ll do the rest next year.”\n\nSix months later the front one is fine and the back four are worse than the ones they replaced.\n\nThis is a real, lovely, human decision and it is the single most expensive thing a homeowner can do. You pay the survey, the mobilisation, the minimum order and the scaffold twice.",
     "Photorealistic photograph of a single new window on the front elevation of a UK semi-detached house while the windows at the back are visibly older, filmed from the pavement, overcast daylight, quietly tragic, symmetrical composition",
     "photo-real", "customers")

