     "Job finder part 1: planning applications. Always has been the single richest untapped source of window work in the country.\n\nWhat it lacked: turning a PDF into a lead, a lead into a survey, a survey into a quote, and a quote into a job — all inside one system, with nothing retyped.\n\nFenora does the whole line. The application has an address, a distance from your depot, a likely spec and an indicative value. That is a quote that writes itself.",
